  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU slave on RS-232 or RS-485. Register numbers are the manual's: 00001 coils, 10001 discrete inputs, 30001 input registers, 40001 holding registers.",
    "The module can also be a Modbus master (tunnel); this map is for the slave mode.",
    "Register numbers are those of the manual (40001 is the first holding register), counted from 1 (address_base 1).",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual (in Spanish); not tested on a device."
  ],
